{"duration_api_ms":14125,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f624c46e-f85a-4cf2-b01d-46d77b643fbf","total_cost_usd":0.00460613,"usage":{"input_tokens":14,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8643,"cache_read_input_tokens":165063,"output_tokens":2451,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":322},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8643,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":616,"cache_read_input_tokens":26097,"cache_creation_input_tokens":528,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":528},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":14,"outputTokens":2451,"cacheReadInputTokens":165063,"cacheCreationInputTokens":8643,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.00460613,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":322,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":8643,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":11,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The fix is in. `slugify(\"Crème brûlée\")` now returns `\"creme-brulee\"`.\n\n**The cause:** the function replaced every character outside `a-z0-9` with a dash. Accented letters like `è` and `û` fall outside that range, so each one became a dash.\n\n**The change** (`src/index.js`): the function now runs `.normalize('NFD')` and strips the combining accent marks (`/\\p{M}/gu`) before lowercasing and replacing. Letters like `è` split into `e` plus a combining mark, and the mark is removed.\n\nI also made two other changes:\n- **Test** (`test/index.test.js`): added an assertion that `slugify('Crème brûlée')` equals `'creme-brulee'`.\n- **Changelog** (`CHANGELOG.md`): added a `### Fixed` entry under `[Unreleased]`, following the project's changelog skill.\n\n**Verification:** `node --test test/index.test.js` passes both tests. My first run used `test/` as the argument and failed, but that was my command, not the code. Running the test file directly is the correct check.\n\n**Known gap:** letters that don't decompose into a base letter plus accent are still dashed. For example, `slugify(\"Straße\")` returns `\"stra-e\"`, because `ß` has no decomposition. Fixing that needs an explicit map (`ß` → `ss`, and similar). I left it alone since you didn't ask for it. Tell me if you want it added.\n\nI haven't committed anything.","ttft_ms":1708,"type":"result","duration_ms":15014,"uuid":"950cd1c3-6591-45f5-b5d3-e752b0a2f539","ttft_stream_ms":1341,"time_to_request_ms":433,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":6,"system_prompt":356,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":2,"input_attachments":11,"input_hooks":1,"conversation_append":1,"tool_pool_refresh":1,"init_message":4,"init_frame_send":2,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":2,"message_prep":2,"model_config_wait":5,"autocompact":1,"request_announcements":4,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":20,"message_normalization":3,"client_creation":2,"request_build":7},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":3,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":104,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":209,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":130,"process_rss_mib_result":230,"process_anon_mib_result":138,"process_peak_rss_mib":235,"process_cpu_ms_turn":1160,"process_wall_ms_turn":15014,"tool_pool_build_co